From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:26:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 19/31] BlueOS: SystemUI: Widget layouts fit one row with the
 margin

Size thresholds include the 8 dp margin (one row is 122.7 dp on the 5x6
grid, 145.5 dp on 4x5): music's big layout needs two rows and the strip
four columns (bigger art in the strip), the big battery ring two rows, the
1x1 ring 56 dp; the player equalizer starts at 4x2. The summary puts
"Sensei" on its own line when the greeting doesn't fit, keeping 24 sp.

Change-Id: I1f354d77337ba9ce068162bc3ef8f132533f206e
